(`CreateEditableBlueprintCopy`, declared in the Kismet module of a cooked-editor
engine fork) and, at runtime only, cooperates with the separate
MifKismetReconstructor plugin (GPL-3.0) through an engine-provided delegate.
Those are distributed separately and are not part of this work.


